/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 41 0 R
/T (Managing personal money is a daily need, yet many people do not keep a record of what they spend. Without a record, it is hard to see where money goes, which makes saving and budgeting difficult. This project is a simple, easy-to-use expense tracking program written in Python that lets a user record, review, and analyse their spending from the terminal or any Python editor.)
/E (Managing personal money is a daily need, yet many people do not keep a record of what they spend. Without a record, it is hard to see where money goes, which makes saving and budgeting difficult. This project is a simple, easy-to-use expense tracking program written in Python that lets a user record, review, and analyse their spending from the terminal or any Python editor.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
