/Title (Most people track expenses in their memory, on scraps of paper, or in complicated apps that need sign-ups, internet access, or a learning curve. These methods are unreliable, easy to forget, and often too heavy for someone who only wants a quick way to note down spending and see totals. There is a need for a lightweight, offline, beginner-friendly tool that:)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 328 0 R
/Next 377 0 R
>>
